Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

Linux kernel patches (guest/kernel/patches/0001-0040)
    Modifications to the Linux kernel, a derivative work of Linux. They are
    licensed under GPL-2.0-only. The full license text is in
    LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt. The kernel itself is not included: build.sh
    downloads it from kernel.org. Copyright in the upstream code belongs to the
    Linux kernel developers; see the COPYING and CREDITS files of the kernel
    source. See guest/kernel/patches/README.md.

Test data generated by third-party tools
    tests/zstd_vectors.h holds compressed byte sequences written by the zstd CLI
    (generator: tests/gen_zstd_vectors.py). tests/inflate_vectors.h holds
    DEFLATE and gzip streams written by zlib, through Python's zlib and gzip
    modules (its header says how). They are data, not code copied from those
    projects.

No other third-party source code is vendored. The image decoders (DEFLATE, zstd,
SHA-256, JSON) and the EROFS writer are written for this project.
